{"availability":"available","full":"djinn/fireagent","name":"fireagent","description":"Opensource implementation of DSec Deepseek Elastic Compute","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-03T17:11:50Z","updated":"2026-10-03T21:17:21Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":null,"color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T21:17:10.983Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T21:17:10.983Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T21:17:10.983Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T21:17:10.983Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:17:10.983Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Elastic agent sandbox platform powered by Firecracker microVMs.","Fireagent creates, manages, and destroys isolated Linux microVMs for AI agents, coding assistants, RL rollout workers, and evaluation jobs. Each sandbox is a stateful session — files, processes, and environment persist across commands.","Architecturally inspired by DeepSeek Elastic Compute (DSec) [[arXiv:2609.22978]]( the production sandbox infrastructure serving 3 million sandboxes daily across 160 nodes at DeepSeek. Fireagent distills DSec's core principles — burst-aware orchestration, multi-backend isolation, stateful session semantics, and RL co-design — into an open-source platform focused on microVM-based isolation via Firecracker."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/djinn/fireagent/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"bb655f018a641c54e4d16269056c3fb3d1a01291a78705544c843aff88d186db","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T21:17:10.983Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T21:17:10.983Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Elastic agent sandbox platform powered by Firecracker microVMs.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/djinn/fireagent/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"bb655f018a641c54e4d16269056c3fb3d1a01291a78705544c843aff88d186db","sourceUrl